---
import LegalPage from "../layouts/LegalPage.astro";

const title = "Quality Policy · Donegal Airport";
const description = "Donegal Airport's Quality Policy — Air Navigation and Airport Services accredited to ISO 9001:2015.";
---

<LegalPage
  title={title}
  description={description}
  eyebrow="Aerodrome"
  heading="Quality Policy"
>
  <p>
    We, the Staff of Donegal Airport Air Navigation Services and Airport Services, are committed to
    providing Air Navigation and Airport Services which fully meet the requirements of our
    customers and regulated clients.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our Quality Objectives are to provide an Air Navigation Service and Airport Service Quality
    Management System which will:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Achieve the highest standards of excellence and safety in the Donegal air traffic airspace and airport services, and provide the highest safety standards possible to customers, staff and suppliers.</li>
    <li>Consistently meet internationally recognised aeronautical operating and safety standards.</li>
    <li>Provide our services at cost-effective prices.</li>
    <li>Reflect our Quality Statement by having a Quality Management System accredited to the ISO 9001:2015 international standard.</li>
    <li>Ensure customer satisfaction by delivering services of consistently high quality, and provide for regular consultation with our customers in the evaluation of the quality of service provided.</li>
    <li>Ensure staff competency by providing appropriate education and training through provision of required funding.</li>
    <li>Establish and review quality objectives, comply with all requirements, and continually improve the effectiveness of the Quality Management System.</li>
  </ul>
</LegalPage>
